# Local-only, per-developer. Both used to be committed and both carried
# absolute paths from one machine (`C:/Users/<name>/...`), which broke
# everyone else: .claude/settings.json registered a PreToolUse hook pointing
# at an executable that does not exist on another machine, so it fired and
# failed on every Bash, Read and Glob call.
.claude/settings.json

# The knowledge graph is a derived artefact (13MB) and is rebuilt locally with
# `graphify update .`. Its sidecars record the interpreter and scan root of
# whoever built it.
graphify-out/
